{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "5a5272ed-98b1-84b6-ae56-823257e02888",
  "created_at": "2026-03-09T12:39:15-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "David Sherman",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:36:53-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:36:56-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, good afternoon. Sure, of course. This is David Sherman. I'm calling about my trash bin. It's gone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:37:04-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gone, okay. Gone as in it never got put back, or somebody took it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:37:10-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, it went out for the pickup and then it just never came back. I put it at the curb, the truck came, and now there's no bin. I've looked up and down the street, and I'm not happy about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:37:25-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry about that. Can you tell me the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:37:30-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, sure. 33 Washington Street, down the Point."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:37:34-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thirty-three Washington. And when was the pickup?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:37:38-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, it'd be, uh, the pickup was Friday. No wait, the rain was Friday into Saturday. It was Saturday, I think. No, the truck came Friday morning, before the rain. Yes, Friday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:37:50-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Friday. Was it blowing around in all that wind and rain, maybe? Sometimes they end up a few streets over."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:37:58-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course, absolutely, I thought of that. I walked the whole block, and I'm eighty-some years old, so that was not a fun walk. Nothing. I've got a shop to run, I can't be hunting for a bin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:38:12-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. [pause] Sir, you're a little faint. Are you on speaker?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:38:17-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, sure, I am. My phone is in the cup holder and I've got the volume down low. Can you hear me now? I'll pick it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:38:28-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's better, thanks. I'll put in a request for a replacement bin at 33 Washington Street. It's noted as missing after Friday's pickup."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:38:37-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, that's fine. Sure. And when's the next pickup? I've got bags piling up and I don't want them sitting out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:38:45-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Your pickup is Friday, so this coming Friday. If the bin hasn't come by then, set the bags out neatly next to the curb and note it with us."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:38:56-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course, yes. Bags by the curb, Friday. Sure. Do you want my number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:39:02-04:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:39:03-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0165."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:39:05-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0165. Someone will call if they need anything else."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:39:10-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. Thank you, Denise. Okay, bye now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T12:39:13-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye, Mr. Sherman."
    }
  ],
